        "collapsible_tab_WE8egq": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Description",
            "icon": "star",
            "content": "<h5><strong>Ceramic Line Cutter: Your Dive Safety Essential</strong></h5><h5>When safety is your top priority, the <strong>Ceramic Line Cutter</strong> is an indispensable tool for every snorkeling and scuba diving adventure. Compact, lightweight, and razor-sharp, this device is designed to free you from entanglements in fishing lines, nets, or underwater vegetation. It’s also perfect for removing debris or trash, helping to keep our oceans clean while you explore.</h5><h5>The cutter features a high-quality ceramic blade housed in a durable ABS handle, ensuring long-lasting performance and resistance to rust or corrosion—even in saltwater. The included hand case keeps the cutter safely stored and ready for action, with versatile mounting options to attach it to your BCD, belt, shoulder strap, or backplate and wing harness.</h5>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_YFRtGK": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "content": "<h5><strong>Compact and Lightweight</strong>: At just 44g and measuring 9 x 4cm, it’s small enough to stay out of the way but ready when you need it.</h5><h5><strong>Sharp Ceramic Blade</strong>: The 3.5cm blade easily cuts through ropes, fishing lines, algae, and other underwater hazards.</h5><h5><strong>Durable ABS Construction</strong>: Built to withstand water exposure and harsh diving environments, ensuring reliable performance dive after dive.</h5><h5><strong>Convenient Mounting Options</strong>: Attach it to your BCD, belt, or harness for easy access, keeping it securely in place.</h5><h5><strong>Eco-Friendly Use</strong>: Perfect for removing debris or fishing nets to keep your dive sites clean and safe.</h5><h5>Every diver needs a reliable line cutter as part of their safety kit. The <strong>Ceramic Line Cutter</strong> combines precision, portability, and durability, ensuring you’re prepared for any underwater challenge. Dive with confidence knowing you’ve got the ultimate safety tool at your side.</h5>",
            "page": ""
          }
